cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite these publicly available reproducibility materials when using the strict U/M matching or statistical reproduction procedures. Software authorship is distinct from manuscript authorship."
title: "TSB-AD U/M Strict Matched Subset: Reproducibility Materials for HA-PaAno"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/zhang-pengui/TSB-AD-UM-Matched-Subset"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Peng
abstract: "Public reproducibility materials supporting the strict same-instance U/M representation analysis reported in HA-PaAno: candidate discovery and verification, mapping manifests, frozen three-seed metrics, and statistical reproduction. This within-TSB-AD subset is not a new independent benchmark, independent OOD evaluation, or full HA-PaAno model implementation. Enumerated original Python code/tests are MIT; original prose and author-licensable mapping, hash-index, metadata, metric and statistical compilations are CC BY 4.0, with third-party rights and conditions preserved. Public availability does not certify third-party rights clearance."
keywords:
  - time-series anomaly detection
  - reproducibility
  - paired representation analysis
